{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55413","headline":"简寂观 · 沈彬","name":"简寂观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山藏胜境当楼台，[□□□□]洞府开。\n白发满头谁肯到，苍苔盈步自偷来。\n风帆闲事抛三日，玉液长生念一盃。\n此路有心星月在，杏坛仙侣莫相猜。\n（按：诗中首联，影宋钞本联写，无空格。\n罗振玉《殷礼在斯堂丛书》校排本《庐山记》补四空格于「当」字下。\n今详诗韵及诗意，所缺当爲第二句之前四字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}